# Init lives under harnesses/<harness>/init/ instead of here, because
# base-rt and moose-initialized seed analytics.events differently:
#  - base-rt: raw SQL into the supervisord-managed ClickHouse on localhost:8123
#  - moose-initialized: declared via a Moose OlapTable in /workspace/moose-project,
#    reconciled by `moose dev`. See harnesses/<id>/init/.
